00:22:31.643 --> 00:22:33.410
Someone else is doing what you're doing.

00:22:33.410 --> 00:22:34.380
Exactly.

00:22:34.380 --> 00:22:36.110
There is more than enough to go around.

00:22:36.110 --> 00:22:37.437
Here's a question for you.

00:22:37.437 --> 00:22:40.310
How many of you bought a pair of shoes?

00:22:40.310 --> 00:22:42.760
How many of you have ever
bought a pair of shoes?

00:22:43.860 --> 00:22:45.240
Okay one pair of shoes, that's good.

00:22:45.240 --> 00:22:46.430
Half of you, no shoes?

00:22:46.430 --> 00:22:47.263
That's fine.

00:22:49.531 --> 00:22:50.364
It's okay.

00:22:50.364 --> 00:22:53.133
How many of you have
bought two pairs of shoes?

00:22:54.510 --> 00:22:55.650
Oh wow look at that.

00:22:55.650 --> 00:22:58.020
How many of you have
bought five pairs of shoes?

00:22:58.020 --> 00:22:59.480
Ten pairs of shoes?

00:22:59.480 --> 00:23:01.990
I'm sure every person that
started a shoe company

00:23:01.990 --> 00:23:04.750
was like "There's
already people doing it."

00:23:04.750 --> 00:23:06.170
No.

00:23:06.170 --> 00:23:07.720
Here's the thing guys.

00:23:07.720 --> 00:23:12.556
There is more people in
the marketplace right now

00:23:12.556 --> 00:23:16.100
that want what you have.

00:23:16.100 --> 00:23:19.740
They are waiting for you, waiting for you,

00:23:19.740 --> 00:23:21.700
to put your message out in the world.

00:23:21.700 --> 00:23:24.000
They need it from your voice.

00:23:24.000 --> 00:23:26.150
They need to connect with you personally.

00:23:26.150 --> 00:23:29.610
They need to hear your story
and that's not scarcity.

00:23:29.610 --> 00:23:30.743
That's abundance.

00:23:31.630 --> 00:23:34.440
Here we go guys, man
let me know if this one

00:23:34.440 --> 00:23:35.800
has gotten you before.

00:23:35.800 --> 00:23:38.173
A lack of confidence.

00:23:39.150 --> 00:23:40.290
Lack of confidence.

00:23:40.290 --> 00:23:41.950
Here's where I fall into it.

00:23:41.950 --> 00:23:45.214
Guys I am standing on a
stage in front of 250 people.

00:23:45.214 --> 00:23:47.443
What is life right now?

00:23:47.443 --> 00:23:48.844
This is crazy!

00:23:48.844 --> 00:23:51.010
But this is where I fall.

00:23:51.010 --> 00:23:54.150
The imposter syndrome,
the imposter syndrome.

00:23:54.150 --> 00:23:55.800
Who am I?

00:23:55.800 --> 00:23:56.970
Who am I to be the person

00:23:56.970 --> 00:23:58.210
to be telling people how to homeschool?

00:23:58.210 --> 00:23:59.930
I just started.

00:23:59.930 --> 00:24:01.590
Who am I to be the person

00:24:01.590 --> 00:24:03.520
to help someone through a divorce?

00:24:03.520 --> 00:24:05.370
I'm not but other people do.

00:24:05.370 --> 00:24:08.918
Who am I to be the person
that's gonna help someone

00:24:08.918 --> 00:24:11.250
learn how to parent their kids?

00:24:11.250 --> 00:24:14.190
Who am I to be the doctor that's online

00:24:14.190 --> 00:24:15.670
helping someone with their problems?

00:24:15.670 --> 00:24:18.280
Who am I to be the artist telling someone

00:24:18.280 --> 00:24:19.580
how they should be create?

00:24:19.580 --> 00:24:22.240
There's people that are better than me.

00:24:22.240 --> 00:24:23.866
But you know what?

00:24:23.866 --> 00:24:25.740
It doesn't matter.

00:24:25.740 --> 00:24:28.490
You have permission to step out.

00:24:28.490 --> 00:24:31.780
You have permission to step out.

00:24:31.780 --> 00:24:32.827
I want you to turn to
your neighbor right now.

00:24:32.827 --> 00:24:34.410
I want you to look them in the eye

00:24:34.410 --> 00:24:36.877
and say "You have permission to do this."

00:24:40.141 --> 00:24:42.550
(crowd chatting)

00:24:42.550 --> 00:24:44.810
Now look at the other person

00:24:44.810 --> 00:24:47.127
and say "No, you have permission.

00:24:47.127 --> 00:24:48.994
"You should be doing this."

00:24:48.994 --> 00:24:51.744
(crowd cheering)

00:24:53.900 --> 00:24:54.733
There we go.

00:24:56.600 --> 00:25:00.920
Guys, imposter syndrome is just a mindset.

00:25:00.920 --> 00:25:05.480
I still fight this every single day.

00:25:05.480 --> 00:25:08.990
There are women who are doing
massive things in the world

00:25:08.990 --> 00:25:10.600
and I think "Who am I?"

00:25:10.600 --> 00:25:13.130
I'm just a college dropout
that lives in Las Vegas

00:25:13.130 --> 00:25:15.000
and homeschools my kids.

00:25:15.000 --> 00:25:16.320
But you know what?

00:25:16.320 --> 00:25:20.450
God has woven a purpose into my heart

00:25:20.450 --> 00:25:23.720
and I am going to stand
on every stage that I can

00:25:23.720 --> 00:25:26.490
and empower as many people as I can

00:25:26.490 --> 00:25:30.320
because no one is gonna tell
me that I'm an imposter.

00:25:30.320 --> 00:25:33.240
Because if I believe
it, they'll believe it.

00:25:33.240 --> 00:25:34.160
All right here we go.

00:25:34.160 --> 00:25:35.872
Comparison, anyone?

00:25:35.872 --> 00:25:39.045
Yes, oh man this one hurts.

00:25:39.045 --> 00:25:40.670
Yes.

00:25:40.670 --> 00:25:41.910
You know when I think about this,

00:25:41.910 --> 00:25:46.003
comparison is the thief of joy.

00:25:47.170 --> 00:25:49.370
The thief of joy.

00:25:49.370 --> 00:25:51.750
I get up every single day

00:25:51.750 --> 00:25:53.500
and I want to live a joyful life.

00:25:53.500 --> 00:25:55.030
It doesn't need to be balanced.

00:25:55.030 --> 00:25:56.610
It doesn't need to be perfect.

00:25:56.610 --> 00:25:59.330
But the one thing I want to be known for

00:25:59.330 --> 00:26:01.705
is I brought joy to the world.

00:26:01.705 --> 00:26:02.960
And you know what happens

00:26:02.960 --> 00:26:05.060
when we start scrolling through Instagram?

00:26:06.120 --> 00:26:07.203
Comparison creeps in.

00:26:08.120 --> 00:26:09.970
You know what happens when we
go to that business conference

00:26:09.970 --> 00:26:13.130
that we're like the new
person on the scene?

00:26:13.130 --> 00:26:15.690
Comparison starts to creep in.

00:26:15.690 --> 00:26:17.610
And so I just want to encourage you

00:26:17.610 --> 00:26:21.260
that you have something
great inside of you.

00:26:21.260 --> 00:26:23.970
And your journey is gonna look different

00:26:23.970 --> 00:26:25.200
than someone else's.

00:26:25.200 --> 00:26:28.050
My path to get to where I want to go

00:26:28.050 --> 00:26:30.900
is not going to be the road
that someone else went down.

00:26:30.900 --> 00:26:34.110
I want to be a trailblazer
for the next generation

00:26:34.110 --> 00:26:36.410
and I want to do it my way.

00:26:36.410 --> 00:26:37.660
But this right here?

00:26:37.660 --> 00:26:40.340
This is the what the enemy is giving me.

00:26:40.340 --> 00:26:41.690
You're not good enough.

00:26:41.690 --> 00:26:42.930
Who are you?

00:26:42.930 --> 00:26:44.230
Why are you doing this?

00:26:44.230 --> 00:26:45.670
They're so much better than you.

00:26:45.670 --> 00:26:47.936
They're already on a yacht in Cancun.

00:26:47.936 --> 00:26:50.090
(crowd laughs)

00:26:50.090 --> 00:26:51.150
Not that that's where I want to go

00:26:51.150 --> 00:26:54.430
but I want to go, I mean if
it's there I want to do it!

00:26:54.430 --> 00:26:55.890
But that's the kind of stuff right?

00:26:55.890 --> 00:26:57.080
Oh their family is perfect.

00:26:57.080 --> 00:26:58.560
Oh wow, they're eating organic food.

00:26:58.560 --> 00:27:00.610
Oh wow, she was able
to do all these things.

00:27:00.610 --> 00:27:04.660
Comparison is the thief of your joy

00:27:05.540 --> 00:27:09.520
and you are the one that controls that.

00:27:09.520 --> 00:27:11.280
You are the one that picks up your phone

00:27:11.280 --> 00:27:12.113
and scrolls through Instagram.

00:27:12.113 --> 00:27:12.946
You are the one

00:27:12.946 --> 00:27:15.960
that actually follows
those people on Instagram.

00:27:15.960 --> 00:27:18.008
Here's a power tip for you.

00:27:18.008 --> 00:27:19.784
Unfollow.

00:27:19.784 --> 00:27:21.110
(crowd laughs and cheers)

00:27:21.110 --> 00:27:21.943
Power tip.

00:27:21.943 --> 00:27:25.790
Unfollow those people.

00:27:25.790 --> 00:27:27.340
Doesn't matter if your sister,

00:27:27.340 --> 00:27:29.420
doesn't matter if it's the guy
that's doing the other thing,

00:27:29.420 --> 00:27:32.090
does not matter who it is, guys.

00:27:32.090 --> 00:27:33.310
We have been tricked to think

00:27:33.310 --> 00:27:35.390
that we need to follow
everyone in the world.

00:27:35.390 --> 00:27:36.363
You don't.

00:27:37.420 --> 00:27:40.160
If they are stealing your joy,

00:27:40.160 --> 00:27:42.650
if you are not going to these platforms

00:27:42.650 --> 00:27:44.800
and feeling fulfilled afterwards

00:27:45.770 --> 00:27:47.840
then you need to unfollow.

00:27:47.840 --> 00:27:48.673
I did this.

00:27:48.673 --> 00:27:49.506
I did this practice

00:27:49.506 --> 00:27:51.770
actually before we started
Grow With Video Live

00:27:51.770 --> 00:27:53.350
I was feeling down.

00:27:53.350 --> 00:27:55.680
Guys I was feeling like "Who am I?"

00:27:55.680 --> 00:27:58.210
One of the idols that I
look up to is Rachel Hollis

00:27:58.210 --> 00:28:01.890
and she just did a
conference with 7,000 women?

00:28:01.890 --> 00:28:04.864
I was like well, I only
got 250 people coming.

00:28:04.864 --> 00:28:06.166
250?

00:28:06.166 --> 00:28:07.310
Come on!

00:28:07.310 --> 00:28:09.070
This is amazing!

00:28:09.070 --> 00:28:10.114
This is awesome!

00:28:10.114 --> 00:28:12.233
(crowd cheering)

00:28:12.233 --> 00:28:14.440
And though I love her so much

00:28:14.440 --> 00:28:15.920
for the message she's
bringing to the world

00:28:15.920 --> 00:28:17.588
guess what I did?

00:28:17.588 --> 00:28:21.240
Unfollowed, unfollowed.

00:28:21.240 --> 00:28:24.070
And guess what I wasn't doing
leading up to this event

00:28:24.070 --> 00:28:25.020
for the last week?

00:28:25.020 --> 00:28:27.700
Comparing myself to her.

00:28:27.700 --> 00:28:30.630
I was letting people like
Mel speak life into me.

00:28:30.630 --> 00:28:32.070
I was letting people like Sean

00:28:32.070 --> 00:28:33.710
tell me that I was made for this.

00:28:33.710 --> 00:28:37.893
I was letting people in
my life actually feed me

00:28:37.893 --> 00:28:40.550
so that I could be here on this stage.

00:28:40.550 --> 00:28:43.010
Y'all this is not normal for me.

00:28:43.010 --> 00:28:44.970
This is not normal for me.

00:28:44.970 --> 00:28:47.843
But I know that this
is where I need to be.

00:28:48.700 --> 00:28:50.440
So here's what I want you to know.

00:28:50.440 --> 00:28:51.343
You're not alone.

00:28:52.220 --> 00:28:53.850
You're not alone in this.

